cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Global Broker Regulatory Licences Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Regulatory authorisations and licence records for FX/CFD, precious metals,
  securities & futures and crypto-asset brokers worldwide. Each record is a
  four-tuple of regulator, licensed legal entity, licence reference and tier,
  each checkable against the issuing authority's public register.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "PAIPAI RANKING (交易商排排网)"
    website: "https://paipaifx.com"
version: "2026.11.21"
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://paipaifx.com/open-data.html"
repository-code: "https://paipaifx.com"
keywords:
  - broker regulation
  - forex
  - CFD
  - licence register
  - financial supervision
  - 监管牌照
